installation:

copy BULL1.TXT to BBS:BULLETINS/BULL?.TXT
copy ACTIVITY to ?

usage:

you must start it every day
Usage: activity <bulletin-nr (1-9)>

the last caller from the day before must have logged off

you can change the logo of BULL?.TXT - but never change the format and the
number of lines of BULL?.txt

also the chars in a line should never be more than 99 (not too much ansi)

if you have a new node - copy the original BULL?.TXT with the right number
of lines to BBS:BULLETINS

please dont change the line "activity graph by qwert"

do not delete the original BULL?.TXT's because if you have a crash and your
BULL.TXT gets deleted the programm can't work any more

ave
qwert